---
import GuideLayout from '../../layouts/GuideLayout.astro';
const guide = {
  "title": "Türkiye e-Visa for Pakistanis: Eligibility & Application",
  "description": "Check conditional e-Visa eligibility for a Pakistani ordinary passport, or follow the responsible mission’s sticker-visa route.",
  "intro": "Check conditional e-Visa eligibility for a Pakistani ordinary passport, or follow the responsible mission’s sticker-visa route.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "Türkiye MFA visa information",
      "url": "https://www.mfa.gov.tr/visa-information-for-foreigners.en.mfa"
    },
    {
      "title": "Official e-Visa service",
      "url": "https://www.evisa.gov.tr/"
    },
    {
      "title": "Turkish Consulate Karachi instructions",
      "url": "https://karachi-cg.mfa.gov.tr/Mission/ShowInfoNote/390232"
    }
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "Check the supporting document",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Pakistani ordinary-passport holders require a visa. Türkiye’s MFA lists a valid Schengen, US, UK or Irish visa or residence permit for conditional access to a one-month single-entry e-Visa. A Canadian visa alone is not in that list. Read all portal conditions for your application."
      ],
      "source": 0
    },
    {
      "heading": "If you are not eligible online",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Use the responsible mission’s sticker-visa instructions and authorised submission channel. Paying a third party for an “e-Visa” cannot replace a qualifying document. Do not answer yes to an eligibility statement you cannot satisfy."
      ],
      "source": 2
    },
    {
      "heading": "Complete the official application",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Enter passport, nationality, dates and supporting-document details accurately. Check the fee and payment method shown for your case. A general USD amount copied from an old guide is not a current quote.",
        "Keep the issued document and verify the passport number, validity, entries and stay period. If your passport, dates or supporting document changes, check whether the original permission still meets the conditions."
      ],
      "source": 1
    },
    {
      "heading": "Prepare for departure",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Keep the qualifying document, visa and requested trip evidence accessible to the airline and border authorities. The validity window is not extra time added to the permitted stay. Follow the applicable passport-validity rule for your intended stay."
      ],
      "source": 2
    },
    {
      "heading": "Use the correct purpose",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Tourism permission is not a universal work or study route. Check the appropriate category for a different activity. If eligibility is unclear, resolve it with the mission before buying non-refundable travel rather than relying on a previous approval or another traveller’s story."
      ],
      "source": 0
    }
  ]
};
---
<GuideLayout {...guide} />
